CHANGES TO THE STABILITY AI MATERIALS (as the agreement asks)

The inference code was ported from Python and PyTorch to C# and TorchSharp. Training, the global illumination estimator (off in the reference service), remeshing and the Metal baker
are not ported. The C++ extensions `texture_baker` and `uv_unwrapper` were reimplemented in C# (a literal port of their logic, checked against their output). The model is
the same: its weights are read as they are, unchanged.

